  "persona": "TEST persona \"Test Person\" as specified in sources.md (Persona section).",
  "conventions": {
    "should": "fill = a careful human with only the persona fills it with `expected`; ask = the user must decide or supply it; never = must not be filled or touched.",
    "expected": "For dropdown/prompt/radio fields `expected` is the exact option label on the page. For checkboxes it is the final checked state. \"\" means the correct final state is empty. Dates are MM/YYYY, YYYY or MM/DD/YYYY.",
    "rows": "Repeating-section rows are numbered by display order (Work Experience 1, 2...). Row order is not significant: match rows by Company / School. Some rows exist only after pressing the section's Add button (see actions).",
    "selectors": "automationId is the Workday-style data-automation-id of the field wrapper (formField-*) or control; selector is a CSS selector for the control. Questionnaire ids are opaque per tenant.",
    "conditional": "Fields with `conditional` are hidden at load; with the persona's answers they must stay hidden and empty."
  },
